{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nusing ll = long long;\n\nconst int MAXN = 1000010;\nint n, K, MOD;\nll fact[MAXN], invFact[MAXN];\nll dp[MAXN], tmp[MAXN];\n\nll modPow(ll base, ll exp) {\n    ll result = 1 % MOD;\n    base %= MOD;\n    while (exp > 0) {\n        if (exp & 1) result = (result * base) % MOD;\n        base = (base * base) % MOD;\n        exp >>= 1;\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n\nll modInverse(ll x) {\n    return modPow(x, MOD - 2);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n    \n    cin >> n >> K >> MOD;\n    \n    fact[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i < MAXN; ++i) {\n        fact[i] = fact[i-1] * i % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    invFact[MAXN-1] = modInverse(fact[MAXN-1]);\n    for (int i = MAXN-2; i >= 0; --i) {\n        invFact[i] = invFact[i+1] * (i+1) % MOD;\n    }\n    \n    ll answer = modPow(K, n);\n    \n    if (n % 2 == 0) {\n        fill(dp, dp + MAXN, 0);\n        dp[n] = fact[n];\n        \n        for (int round = 1; round <= K; ++round) {\n            fill(tmp, tmp + MAXN, 0);\n            \n            for (int mask = n; mask; mask = (mask - 1) & n) {\n                if (dp[mask] == 0) continue;\n                \n                for (int sub = mask; (sub << 1) >= mask; sub = (sub - 1) & mask) {\n                    tmp[mask ^ sub] = (tmp[mask ^ sub] + dp[mask] * invFact[sub]) % MOD;\n                }\n            }\n            \n            copy(tmp, tmp + MAXN, dp);\n            \n            ll contrib = dp[0];\n            for (int i = 0; i < round; ++i) {\n                contrib = contrib * (K - i) % MOD;\n            }\n            answer = (answer - contrib + MOD) % MOD;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    cout << answer % MOD << '\\n';\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MAXN = 1000010;\n    static int n, K, MOD;\n    static long[] fact = new long[MAXN];\n    static long[] invFact = new long[MAXN];\n    static long[] dp = new long[MAXN];\n    static long[] tmp = new long[MAXN];\n\n    static long modPow(long base, long exp) {\n        long result = 1 % MOD;\n        base %= MOD;\n        while (exp > 0) {\n            if ((exp & 1) == 1) {\n                result = (result * base) % MOD;\n            }\n            base = (base * base) % MOD;\n            exp >>= 1;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n\n    static long modInverse(long x) {\n        return modPow(x, MOD - 2);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        K = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        MOD = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        \n        fact[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i < MAXN; ++i) {\n            fact[i] = fact[i-1] * i % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        invFact[MAXN-1] = modInverse(fact[MAXN-1]);\n        for (int i = MAXN-2; i >= 0; --i) {\n            invFact[i] = invFact[i+1] * (i+1) % MOD;\n        }\n        \n        long answer = modPow(K, n);\n        \n        if (n % 2 == 0) {\n            Arrays.fill(dp, 0);\n            dp[n] = fact[n];\n            \n            for (int round = 1; round <= K; ++round) {\n                Arrays.fill(tmp, 0);\n                \n                for (int mask = n; mask != 0; mask = (mask - 1) & n) {\n                    if (dp[mask] == 0) continue;\n                    \n                    for (int sub = mask; (sub << 1) >= mask; sub = (sub - 1) & mask) {\n                        tmp[mask ^ sub] = (tmp[mask ^ sub] + dp[mask] * invFact[sub]) % MOD;\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                System.arraycopy(tmp, 0, dp, 0, MAXN);\n                \n                long contrib = dp[0];\n                for (int i = 0; i < round; ++i) {\n                    contrib = contrib * (K - i) % MOD;\n                }\n                answer = (answer - contrib + MOD) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(answer % MOD);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00011646069469861686, -4.172316494077677e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00039772229501977563, -2.52720492426306e-05, -0.17987999320030212, -0.6332494020462036, -0.003951480612158775, -1.6569954823353328e-05, -0.0003216941258870065, -0.00022909401741344482, -5.07818695041351e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -4.207999518257566e-05, -0.0028087948448956013, -0.000432278640801087, -0.038955628871917725, -0.35392263531684875, -8.344646857949556e-07, -4.887569048150908e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -3.099436753473128e-06, -7.652943895664066e-05, -4.887569048150908e-06, -0.0548923499